# {{ project_name }}

Databricks Asset Bundle generated by polymo for the `{{ stream_name }}` stream.

- `databricks.yml` — bundle, `whl` artifact, pipeline resource (`{{ catalog }}.{{ schema }}`)
- `pyproject.toml` — packages `src/{{ pkg }}` as the wheel (built via `uv build --wheel`)
- `src/{{ pkg }}/client.py` — generated fetch/schema code, no polymo import at runtime
- `src/{{ pkg }}/source.py` — the DataSource + reader, built on `{{ pkg }}.client`
- `pipelines/{{ stream }}.py` — imports the DataSource from `{{ pkg }}.source`, wires the `@dp.table`

## Deploy

Requires [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) on the deploy machine (builds the wheel).

    databricks bundle deploy -t dev
    databricks bundle run -t dev {{ pipeline_key }}

Table lands at `{{ catalog }}.{{ schema }}.{{ table_name }}`. Use `-t prod` for production.
Runs `serverless: true`; a classic cluster needs the wheel as a cluster library instead.
